stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Gate: allocation preflight
  Gate --> V3Authority: stable tmux >= 3.7b<br/>fixture and identity pass
  Gate --> FailedClosed: malformed or below-min<br/>stable tmux version
  Gate --> V2SafePath: eligible non-version gate failure<br/>before V3 authority publication
  V3Authority --> Control: publish V3 authority<br/>and lease one tmux -C client
  V3Authority --> FailedClosed: V3 publication or binding failure
  Control --> Snapshot: notification or final action
  Snapshot --> Control: exact fenced snapshot
  Control --> Lost: EOF percent exit or identity change
  Lost --> Reconnect: new client and fresh fence
  Reconnect --> Control: socket server source match
  Reconnect --> Residual: mismatch or reconnect failure
  V2SafePath --> [*]
  FailedClosed --> [*]
  Control --> [*]: settled exact close
  Residual --> [*]: retain recovery metadata
